  "description": "Lee Do-hyun, a bodyguard, perceives the world in slow motion—a lingering aftereffect of brain surgery. After stumbling upon 10 billion won in illicit slush funds, he takes a stand against a powerful, corrupt cartel on behalf of its victims. Amidst a vast conflict woven with politics, crime, and conspiracy, his unique ability becomes the key to uncovering the truth.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
